534
00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:46.560
I missed you.

535
00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:47.440
I missed you.

536
00:21:48.560 --> 00:21:50.200
I just want to know if you want to hang out.

537
00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:52.100
Aw, I do want to hang out.

538
00:21:52.100 --> 00:21:53.140
I would like to hang out.

539
00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:54.100
Great.

540
00:21:54.440 --> 00:21:55.840
So, when are we getting together?

