00:25:32.980 --> 00:25:36.260
Is it true that you first auditioned for the role of Michael Scott?

630
00:25:36.540 --> 00:25:38.820
Tell us your office origin story.

631
00:25:38.820 --> 00:25:41.380
Oh, I have a great office origin story.

632
00:25:42.540 --> 00:25:44.080
I love to tell the story.

633
00:25:44.160 --> 00:25:44.720
It's fantastic.

634
00:25:45.120 --> 00:25:49.420
I was starting to do this show Six Feet Under and I was just at the very beginning of that

635
00:25:50.020 --> 00:25:50.500
show.

636
00:25:50.720 --> 00:25:53.620
