637
00:25:53.840 --> 00:25:58.160
And it was a very widely, highly regarded show.

638
00:26:00.280 --> 00:26:04.980
And I got cast in this Janine Garofalo comedy pilot for ABC.

639
00:26:06.740 --> 00:26:10.580
And, you know, it was a very small role, but I was like, hey, you know, it's an amazing

640
00:26:10.580 --> 00:26:11.060
paycheck.

641
00:26:12.740 --> 00:26:13.520
This is great.

642
00:26:13.540 --> 00:26:14.660
I'm going to be a series regular.

643
00:26:14.860 --> 00:26:21.220
It was my first, like, real stab at a series regular job, which is a lot better money than

644
00:26:21.220 --> 00:26:23.980
