00:31:39.090 --> 00:31:41.290
of like personal space.

764
00:31:41.450 --> 00:31:42.190
He does not.

765
00:31:42.530 --> 00:31:45.310
He could be talking to someone like four inches away from them.

766
00:31:45.470 --> 00:31:47.390
And I thought, I always thought that was really funny.

767
00:31:48.390 --> 00:31:57.050
And, um, where I talked about my girlfriend being stationed in Kuwait and, um, that was

