00:58:13.240 --> 00:58:14.240
Conflicting advice.

1248
00:58:14.660 --> 00:58:17.700
I have two background catches that just delighted me.

1249
00:58:18.140 --> 00:58:18.600
Oh.

1250
00:58:18.940 --> 00:58:19.560
