1254
00:58:26.900 --> 00:58:28.940
Because Kevin's donut is my donut.

1255
00:58:29.060 --> 00:58:29.980
The sprinkles donut.

1256
00:58:30.160 --> 00:58:30.480
Yes.

1257
00:58:30.760 --> 00:58:32.280
And Andy had the powdered sugar.

1258
00:58:32.900 --> 00:58:33.200
Okay.

1259
00:58:33.580 --> 00:58:34.900
Background catch number two.

1260
00:58:35.140 --> 00:58:36.760
I love it when our show does this.

1261
