Yep.

1267
00:58:47.220 --> 00:58:52.020
Kevin's coffee mug is the same mug that Kelly gave to him at her customer survey party.

1268
00:58:52.200 --> 00:58:54.340
You know, everyone's face in the big star.

1269
00:58:54.780 --> 00:58:56.560
But what about Andy's mug?

1270
00:58:57.340 --> 00:59:00.360
Andy's mug is the same one from Moroccan Christmas.

1271
00:59:01.040 --> 00:59:03.820
And it was featured in a deleted scene I talked about.

1272
00:59:03.980 --> 00:59:08.400
When Jim and Pam decide to shop within the office for Christmas for each other because

1273
00:59:08.400 --> 00:59:12.220
they're so broke, Jim goes up to Andy and asks him about his mug.

1274
00:59:12.700 --> 00:59:14.160
And it's in the bloopers.

1275
00:59:14.320 --> 00:59:15.360
It was also in the script.

1276
00:59:15.780 --> 00:59:18.200
Two coffee mugs from two prior episodes.

1277
00:59:18.400 --> 00:59:19.020
I love that.

1278
00:59:19.400 --> 00:59:24.060
Well, later in this episode, if you look at Oscar's desk, he's going to have his America's

1279
00:59:24.060 --> 00:59:25.080
Got Talent mug too.

1280
00:59:25.500 --> 00:59:25.860
Ah!

1281
00:59:26.080 --> 00:59:26.640
Love it.

1282
00:59:30.360 --> 00:59:32.520
Much bigger in the actual shooting draft.

1283
00:59:32.700 --> 00:59:35.420
And there are a few deleted scenes and things I want to share.

1284
00:59:35.760 --> 00:59:39.060
First of all, this is the scene that would have set up this whole storyline.

1285
00:59:39.620 --> 00:59:42.560
It's at the beginning of the day and they're getting in the elevator.

1286
00:59:43.000 --> 00:59:44.500
Kevin, Jim, and Pam.

1287
00:59:44.760 --> 00:59:46.260
And who rushes in at the last minute?

1288
00:59:46.380 --> 00:59:48.420
Because she works in the Scranton Business Park.

1289
00:59:48.760 --> 00:59:49.500
But Lynn.

1290
00:59:50.000 --> 00:59:50.800
Can we hear it?

1291
